    <!-- Accessibility service (Settings → Accessibility → monki-focus). -->
    <string name="accessibility_service_description">monki-focus reads the screen of the apps and browsers you set rules for, to recognise feeds such as Reels and Shorts, and the address bar of supported browsers. It also watches its own pages in Settings so protection is not turned off by accident. It never stores or sends what is on screen: only the app, the site and which kind of screen it is, on this phone.</string>

